-- section 4.13 defer: DEFER-01 general accept (check-only positive)
-- @req: DEFER-01
-- @expected-pass-after: phase-32
-- A general `defer <statement>` (here: `defer println("{x}")`) must be accepted
-- by the analyzer once the Phase-21 `defer free`-only gate (E0276) is removed.
-- The CTest asserts E0276 is ABSENT via whole-pipeline negation (GREEN in Plan
-- 32-02). The deferred statement runs at the normal fall-through exit edge, so
-- intended stdout is `body` then `1`. (`print` takes a String, so the Int x is
-- printed via interpolation.)

func main() {
    var x = 1
    defer println("{x}")
    println("body")
}
